  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clothes",
     "texto": [
      "Nouns also form their plural: **bluză → bluze**, **rochie → rochii**, **fustă → fuste**. The definite article is attached to the noun again: **tricou → tricoul** («T-shirt → the T-shirt»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Singular and plural",
     "texto": [
      "**Pantof** is «shoe» and **pantofi**, «shoes». When talking about trousers, Romanian usually uses the plural **pantaloni** directly, just as English does with «trousers»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
